: "\u0421\u043e\u0437\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043b\u043e\u0433\u0430", "created_at": "2020-12-06T20:07:14Z", "repo": "duck-simulator", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "034cace830b41627cd3792b278f299041c63a24d", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2020-12-06T14:42:34Z", "repo": "duck-simulator", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "938a63162c7c0ce9da79490d66c6ee1ee94235cc", "message": "Noted solution for stuck \"in main menu\"\n\n#9 (thanks @ItssUri)", "created_at": "2026-01-09T20:16:36Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0a619ae82ccc37f902f4898fe23fa4395ece03a4", "message": "Fixed reading issue (oops)", "created_at": "2023-09-21T18:24:31Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "00695d0527f946704540cbdb723d0e6a7f1b8fc5", "message": "Added mention of the wotlk branch", "created_at": "2023-09-21T09:35:51Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4737a629132e5197a811c8982ec6c965b8cfc478", "message": "Fix decoding and blurring issue for scaled or old (3.3.5) UI (#5)\n\nFixes #4 and #1.\r\n\r\nVersions of WoW before 3.3.5 had a problem with processing frames that stood close to each other, which caused blurring between them, which did not allow normal processing of a multicolored array of data (incorrect colors caused the script to crash and display \"In Main Menu\"). Moreover, if the user had changed in-game scaling or used scaling in the OS itself, it resulted in incorrect calculation of pixel size, which also caused blurring.\r\n\r\nIn this Pull Request, I have rewritten the algorithm for reading a multicolored array of data to account for these cases, and I have also added an automatic scale edit for the addon frames themselves to be independent of the player interface scaling. Special thanks to @CheeseKeik for helping me come up with and write the algorithm", "created_at": "2023-09-20T21:30:29Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "caeaad8f39d53139c64cd37b63a7db6c5ad2fa25", "message": "Fixed non-valid XP format for <1000XP", "created_at": "2022-07-09T10:39:58Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3485616f8cfca875a7bba9051a52285515614706", "message": "Added support for versions <4.0.1", "created_at": "2022-05-16T18:46:12Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ba174247933ecb262c26eff898f31bc9105bc4a3", "message": "Fixed line link in README", "created_at": "2022-05-04T20:25:09Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9d8143a59577c18a380008a51373c239d531c6dc", "message": "Added more precise zone checking", "created_at": "2022-05-04T20:21:47Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e7bcb04c5c8c52433c9304760e0d1d24593db6c4", "message": "Added windowed mode and pixel resizing compatibility", "created_at": "2022-01-29T16:12:53Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6f961b2e383f0456f3d2614e1e883428e3237eb2", "message": "Added flexibility to adjust pixels size", "created_at": "2022-01-29T14:33:54Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "afd9015ae360198790e77247d23b2b67c3475b59", "message": "Minor changes and preventing variable name conflict", "created_at": "2022-01-29T14:32:41Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c73069352c36bb0923e6a7db794277bb5d980d2a", "message": "Rewrote a status update method.\n\nPrevious method (using WORLD_MAP_UPDATE event) was resource-intensive due to the fact, that this event is firing dozens of times when you're standing near the border of a zone or a region. This caused huge framerate issues in places like Black Mountain, some spots in Timeless Isle, and almost all borders of zones and regions. New method uses kind of timer loop, which checks if you're in a new zone or a region every 2 seconds.", "created_at": "2021-04-14T17:11:19Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0a449b8bb331668bf019ccc70acd5b5dd24ec008", "message": "Fixed modules installation", "created_at": "2021-04-12T19:50:32Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "57216af7c2f02e0e9e7c8952bf12acad828fcab8", "message": "Corrected grammatical errors", "created_at": "2021-04-12T19:49:36Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a53689b26c8713b8ae6c2ca587a9d72a71ed7cec", "message": "Added comment for <5.0.4", "created_at": "2021-04-12T19:45:36Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fb060f38643eaeeb70395fe3b5df18d158560254", "message": "Fixed addon init while loading (kinda)", "created_at": "2021-04-12T19:44:32Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9fc818a232a20506a46d858f6ae6ad1b96b28aa5", "message": "Fixed image grab for windowed mode", "created_at": "2021-04-12T19:41:00Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "74e7b694ee051736e052c410d4cce8415a077474", "message": "Added logging and comments", "created_at": "2021-04-12T15:22:17Z", "repo": "wow-discord-rpc", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6d0363b766f6a42e4a